  * *note isAlmostLexModule: isAlmostLexModule, -- whether a monomial module
    over an exterior algebra is almost lex
  * *note lexIdeal: (ExteriorIdeals)lexIdeal, -- compute the lex ideal with a
    given Hilbert function in an exterior algebra

