|     | 0      0      e_1e_2 e_2e_3e_4 0         |                            |
|     | 0      0      0      0         e_2e_3e_4 |                            |
|                                                                             |
|             3      5                                                        |
|o2 : Matrix E  <-- E                                                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|_2*e_3*e_4}}                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M=image m                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = image | e_1e_2 e_3e_4 0      0         0         |                      |
|           | 0      0      e_1e_2 e_2e_3e_4 0         |                      |
|           | 0      0      0      0         e_2e_3e_4 |                      |
|                                                                             |
