    exterior algebra is lex
  * *note isHilbertSequence: (ExteriorIdeals)isHilbertSequence, -- whether the
    given sequence is a Hilbert sequence
  * *note lexModule: lexModule, -- compute the lex submodule with a given
    Hilbert sequence in a free module

